Interior Ministry spokesman: 72 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on December 24
(Phnom Penh): At least 72 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 24, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on December 25, 2023.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 72 suspects, 46 were arrested in 22 drug cases and 26 were arrested in eight criminal cases.
Oleshchuk's claim comes just hours after Russia's Defense Ministry said its air defense system had shot down four Ukrainian military planes in the past 24 hours, just two days later. Ukrainian President Recep Tayyip Erdogan has acknowledged that Ukrainian forces shot down three Russian warplanes.
Ministry of Water Resources announces weather condition in Cambodia for December 25, 2023
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a notification on the weather situation in the Kingdom of Cambodia for December 25, 2023.
On the 25th and 26th, the high pressure system on China will continue to dominate Cambodia with moderate to strong northeast monsoon, and from December 27, the high pressure system from China and the northeast monsoon will Weak.
This situation will make: From December 25 to 26, 2023, the weather in the provinces adjacent to the Dangrek Mountains and the northeastern plateau will continue to cool in the morning. From December 27, the cold weather will decrease with increasing temperature.
The ministry called for vigilance, health care and proper clothing to prevent possible diseases.
Cambodia hosts first mountain festival in Pursat
