The above event is organized in order to promote the local tourism movement in accordance with the spirit of the Ministry of Tourism "Patriotism to know the land" to promote tourism potential and investment in 1,500 mountainous areas, Veal Veng district, Pursat province, especially new tourism products, luxury tourism resorts. And beautiful nature as the destination of "Hidden Flowers" of Pursat Province.
In addition, to link the public-private sector, especially to encourage investors to target 1,500 tourist destinations in the mountains and show the attention of the Ministry of Tourism by organizing various tourist attractions.
