The Minister of Rural Development made some recommendations to the officials in the meeting to review the work for December 2023 and the target for March 2024
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhay Rithy Sen, Minister of Rural Development, made some recommendations to subordinates during the meeting to review the work progress for December 2023 and the work direction for January 2024 of the Ministry of Rural Development, which was held on the 25th. December 2023 at the Ministry of Rural Development.
In order to achieve the Pentagon strategy of the Royal Government under the leadership of His Majesty the Prime Minister Hun Manet and to achieve the vision of Cambodia with high middle income in 2030 and high income in 2050, the Minister recommended Provide the following points to the meeting:
* Continue to develop rural transportation infrastructure based on the 70% restoration and strengthening approach and build new roads at a rate of 30%.
* Examine the roles and responsibilities of officials and the Ministry, as well as all units under the Ministry to meet the actual needs of local people.
* Continue to improve the lives of people in rural areas by planning with clear indicators, especially strengthening the training of basic skills and life skills, the development of model villages and rural credit to target and clear goals.
* Strengthen the implementation of work in accordance with the rules, regulations, personal discipline and responsibilities. The Governor of Phnom Penh instructed the traffic police to stop wearing civilian clothes to intercept illegal vehicles, but must wear the right uniform
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khuong Sreng, the Governor of Phnom Penh, instructed the traffic police officers to stop wearing civilian clothes and stand in ambush to intercept vehicles that violate the law, that is, they must wear uniforms properly to avoid criticism from the people.
Mr. Khuong Sreng said this on the morning of December 25, 2023 in the meeting of the Phnom Penh Administrative Unity Command to strengthen the implementation of the land traffic law in accordance with the recommendations of the Prime Minister of Cambodia Hun Manet. Samdech has already said that he is the backbone of our forces in enforcing the law.
The Governor of Phnom Penh confirmed that the traffic police force does not only work on traffic issues, but must cooperate in maintaining security and order, that is, making sure that the villages and communes are safe. He said that security work is to be done regularly, especially at the end of this year, there is a lot of work to be done to protect security and order to the people because there are many fun programs that the forces have to protect.
In addition, he instructed the district governor to inspect and strengthen the implementation of construction laws at local construction sites, whether there is a permit to maintain the safety of construction does not pose a risk to the people. He added that there is a need to review the provision of services to the people in order to make the one-stop service better and more fully satisfied with the people.
Mr. Khuong Sreng mentioned the preparation of the inauguration ceremony of the Choeung Ek Wastewater Treatment Plant in Tuol Roka 1 Village, Sangkat Chak Angre Krom, Khan Meanchey under the Grant Cooperation Fund of the Government of Japan under the high presidency of His Excellency Hun Manet Minister of Cambodia this morning, December 27.
In particular, the authorities must be ready to maintain security and traffic order on the 25th anniversary of the end of the war in Cambodia under the policy of win-win on December 29 (1998-2023) at the Victory Monument under the presidency of His Majesty Hun Manet, as well as all authorities Must be ready to maintain order during the Global New Year, especially January 7 to commemorate the 45th anniversary of the country's liberation from the Pol Pot regime.
