Leaked Voice of Mr. Teav Vannul, President of the Candlelight Party, expressed regret that the leaders of the National Forces Party did not join its alliance
(Phnom Penh): On December 25, 2023, the voice of Mr. Teav Vannul, President of the Candlelight Party, was expressed, expressing regret and disappointment for the leaders of the National Forces Party who refused to join their alliance.
Through this leak, Mr. Teav Vannul criticized that in the past, the Candlelight Party called the National Forces Party to join the alliance, and he did not come to the alliance, saying that this alliance is very messy and can not achieve its goal.
"We regret that we asked him to form a party, but he said that the coalition could not work, this mess is an excuse and the ambition of the leaders of the National Forces Party," he said.
