Senior officials of the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications close the training course on "Digital Revolutionary Leadership"
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khov Makara, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications, presided over the closing ceremony of the training course on "Digital Revolutionary Leadership" for leaders from Deputy Director General to Secretary of State from December 18 to 20, 2023, with a total of 30 participants, 12 women from the Ministry of Tourism, Ministry of Women's Affairs and the Police Academy of Cambodia.
