(Rattanakiri): The CPP Committee of Rattanakiri Province on the morning of December 24, 2023 held a meeting to disseminate the Extraordinary General Assembly of the Cambodian People's Party, which was held on December 9-10, 2023 at January 7 monument.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, Chairman of the Provincial Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, Deputy Chairman of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Permanent Working Group, on behalf of General Chiang Am, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense and Chairman of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Government Working Group.
