Understand the business: Well-known businessmen recommend that businesses should choose the right loan to avoid bankruptcy because of insurance with high interest loans (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): A well-known businessman recommended to business people Or the business owner chooses the right source of loan to avoid the risk of bankruptcy due to insurance with high interest loans.
Every businessman or entrepreneur needs capital to start a business or expand a business, part of which is his own and partly from borrowing.
Duke Dr. Kouch Mengly, Founder and CEO of Mengly JSC. Kouch Education states that almost 100% of all business people and entrepreneurs have debts, some of which come from banks, relatives or friends.
He said that choosing the source of lending is very important, so all businesses should choose loans from banks that offer low interest rates, avoid private loans, online loans and from financial institutions with high interest rates. High.
The urge to choose a bank loan for this business is due to the fact that bank loans have a low interest rate of less than 10%, while most businesses are not able to earn a profit of more than 10% to 15% per annum. If you choose a loan from a bank with an interest rate higher than 18%, it will make your business more vulnerable to bankruptcy because profits are not equal to interest.
