Samdech Hun Sen Presides Over Two Formulas to Promote Cambodian Products to Overseas Markets (Phnom Penh) The first is the product that determines and the second. Market demand determines the export of Cambodian products to foreign markets.
This statement was made by Samdech President Hun Manet on the occasion of the closing ceremony of the meeting to summarize the business results of 2023 and the direction of 2024 business of the Ministry of Commerce on the afternoon of December 22, 2023.
Samdech explained these two formulas that the first formula is a product determinant, which means that the product is a special product based on geography, no one can produce. For example, Kampot pepper products, which are manufactured under the GI, can not be produced in any country, only in Cambodia in Kampot. Therefore, Cambodia needs to strengthen the production of this product, then find a market in other countries.
The second formula is to determine the market demand, that is, to find and define the market and then orient the production to be in the market. But for this recipe, other countries also have most of those products.
