A: The Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (RCEP) * The RCEP was signed by His Majesty the King on October 5, 2021 and entered into force on January 1, 2022. . * Recognized as the largest multilateral free trade agreement in the world and the most important trade agreement after the World Trade Organization (WTO).
