What is an agricultural concept and a food concept?
At the 2023 CPC Central Working Committee meeting, Xi Jinping stressed the need to develop agricultural concepts and food, agriculture, forestry, animal husbandry and fisheries development at the same time to create a diversified food supply system.
"Agriculture" is modern agriculture that compares to traditional agriculture as socialization, which generally uses modern techniques and sciences, raw materials produced by modern industry and controlled by modern means. In the history of agricultural development, divided into components and levels of agricultural production capacity, it was the most recent stage of agriculture.
"Food concept" is a kind of concept on "the need for calories and protein from farmland, grasslands, forests and the sea, and from plants, animals and micro-organisms to explore food resources by all means in all directions." This is one of the main reasons why China is reforming its agricultural supply.
The basis of the "food concept" is food. China, a very populous country, the ruling party has always considered food production and agricultural supply as the main tasks, including arrangements to increase production capacity of soybeans and oil ingredients, accelerate beef production. Lamb and milk, improving the quality of fisheries development, etc. have all clearly demonstrated the "food concept".
