Ministry of Culture: "Cambodia-China Culture and Film Exchange Week 2023" successfully held in Circus
(Phnom Penh): The "Cambodia-China Culture and Film Exchange Week 2023" held in Xiamen, Fujian Province, People's Republic of China has been successfully completed from 19 to 20 December. 2023.
Mr. Hap Touch, Secretary of State, on behalf of Dr. Pheung Sakona, Minister of Culture and Fine Arts, led a delegation from the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts and Cambodian filmmakers to attend the event.
The program is co-organized by the Huli District Administration, Xiamen City, the Organizing Committee of the Asian Film Festival of Cambodia and the Department of Film Arts and Cultural Promotion, with the support of the Fujian Provincial Film Office, the Xiamen Film Office and the Xiamen University Film School.
During the two-day event, four Cambodian films were screened to the public in theaters in Siem Reap, as well as an exhibition of Cambodian art. In addition, the delegation also visited the Film School of Circus University and discussed the opportunities and challenges of co-production, the growth of film performance.
Please be informed that the "Cambodia-China Culture and Film Exchange Week" aims to promote and enhance cultural dialogue and bilateral relations, especially between the people of Cambodia and the people of Xiamen, as the two countries celebrate the 65th anniversary. Of diplomatic relations in 2023.
