In fact, the Ministry of Economy and Finance has started publishing the draft law on finance for management in 2023 on the ministry's website for the first time, which in the past has only published a summary of the implementation of the draft law on finance.
Under the coordination of the General Secretariat of the Steering Committee for Public Financial Management Reform (ACHRC), Cambodia participated in the Budget Openness Survey organized by the International Budget Partnership and held every two years. Once a year since 2008.
Over the past decade, Cambodia has made good progress in preparing and disseminating key budget documents, moving from a slow preparation to a timely preparation from not publishing for some to public dissemination.
Cambodia's rise in OBS scores reflects the will of the Royal Government and its stakeholders, as well as the high level of commitment and commitment that led Cambodia to make good progress in promoting budget transparency and public financial reform as a whole. .
