The Minister also mentioned the Ministry's plan, which has been preparing a strategic plan for the management and development of water resources and meteorology in the next five years.
Please be informed that since 1999, under the cooperation with Korea Water Corporation (K-Water), the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has implemented many projects, including feasibility study projects, master plan study projects and technical advisors of irrigation development projects. .
