Fourth, the Ministry has been authorized to implement the "Environmental Strategy" 2023-2028, with three angles, including "strengthening policy, building a digital administration and expanding the promotion towards a carbon neutral country and 60% forest cover by 2050 "in response to global efforts to achieve the pentagonal strategic goals.
