Mr. Ban Boroth, Director General of Administration and Finance, read out the message of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia on the occasion of the 25th Cambodian Day of Persons with Disabilities and the 41st International Day of Persons with Disabilities. .
During the ceremony, the Minister instructed all civil servants, contract officers and staff with disabilities as follows:
