(Kampong Thom): In the celebration of the 25th Cambodian Day of Persons with Disabilities and the 41st International Day of Persons with Disabilities under the theme of Practical Solutions for a Comfortable Society and Equity on the morning of December 20 2023 in Santuk district. Mr. Ly Veth, Deputy Governor of Kampong Thom Province, said that innovative solutions for a society are comfortable and equitable.
