(Phnom Penh): An investigating judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court has decided to detain nine Chinese and one Cameroonian in connection with a case of beating and attempting to kill a Chinese national in Boeung Keng Kang district. This is according to Mr. I Rin, spokesman for the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on the morning of December 18, 2023.
