Police said that before the incident, the police were patrolling in the local area, when they arrived at the scene, they suddenly found a case of violence and the police force intervened to arrest the perpetrator along with the evidence to the Boeung Keng Kang District Police for questioning. . The seriously injured were taken to hospital.
