Minister Hun Many is satisfied with the organization of the 2023 Commune Agriculture Officer Examination Process and considers it a good start of the civil service examination reform (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): As already set, on December 17, 2023, from 12 noon to 5 pm is the process of selecting commune agriculture officials in 2023 with 3,381 candidates. The exam is held at the Royal University of Phnom Penh.
Mr. HUN Many, Minister of Public Works and Chairman of the Examination Organizing Committee, expressed his satisfaction with the smooth conduct of the examination process, which ensured the transparency, accuracy, fairness and acceptance of all parties. All the stages of choosing the subject and the exam stage.
In an interview with reporters after opening the symbolic package, Mr. HUN Many claimed that from the initial preparation until the beginning of the exam was smooth. While the head of the subject also fully ensures that the candidates are not leaked or not known, that is, the head of the subject is selected immediately on the day of the exam.
The Minister emphasized that starting from 6 am at the examination center of the Royal University of Phnom Penh, he and the working group of the organizing committee, including observers from the Anti-Corruption Unit, divided the subject into three categories, including: Agricultural skills, English and general knowledge. He said that in each subject, choose 10 questions out of 30 questions submitted by professional professors and professional officials from relevant ministries and institutions.
He said: "Our organization is thorough, focusing on what is the past experience, we do a series of public outreach to let people know about the progress of our organization "To ensure that there are no disciplines, we do it today, with the participation of different parties, we print immediately and the exam process."
As for ensuring the transparency of the exam, Minister Hun Many said that the exam is in line with past standards, with the participation of the Anti-Corruption Unit and observers from all walks of life. He added that this competition for the selection of commune agricultural officials is the first experience organized by the Ministry of Public Works, so this time is considered as an experience of what is a good point to continue to apply for the civil service recruitment exam in the future.
As for the procedure of the revision rate stage, Mr. HUN Many said that it will start on December 18, 2023 tomorrow, starting from cutting off the head of the worksheet and entering the password before preparing the version. He stressed that in order to ensure transparency at this stage of the revision, the subject chair and the editor are not the same person, that is, the subject director and the editor.
From the day of the exam until the day of release, the results may take a week, which may end on December 24, 2023, and to ensure the implementation of the time limit depends on this speed. Versioning, however, should not last more than a week. This is according to Mr. Hun Many's additional claim.
Overall, Mr. HUN Many expressed his happiness for this good starting point and will take good experience to apply in the civil service recruitment exam in the future.
For Mr. Dith Tina, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries also expressed the same opinion as Mr. Hun Many, that is, the Ministry of Agriculture expects to have competent officials to serve the people at the local level, so the biggest goal The purpose of organizing this exam is to get really qualified officers.
Please be informed that the 2023 Commune Agriculture Officer Competition will start from 12:00 noon until 5:00 pm, with candidates having to pass the exam in 3 categories: 1: Agricultural Writing, 2: Multiple answers, 3: English writing test. A total of 3,381 candidates will compete in the 2023 Commune Agriculture Officers Competition at the Royal University Examination Center in Phnom Penh.
