Key Remarks by Samdech Mani Hun Manet, Opportunity to Meet and Meet with Cambodian People in Japan
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of December 16, 2023, Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Lok Chumteav Bandit met with the Cambodian people in Japan on the occasion of Samdech's participation in the Japan-ASEAN Summit.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet, the opportunity to meet with the Cambodian people in Japan:
Samdech Hun Sen considers it strange that those who accuse Samdech of leading thousands of people to attend the Samdech program in Japan are strange
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that unity is the spirit of nationalism
* Samdech Hun Manet thanked the team of Minister Heng Sour for organizing with the Cambodian Embassy and Association in Japan for the current meeting.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet sends a message to those who plan to gather, cursing Samdech that expressing opinions must be done with dignity so as not to tarnish Cambodia's image
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the Japanese invitation and the meeting with more than 2,000 people at this time is a message of recognition of Samdech as the legitimate Prime Minister of Cambodia.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the more than 6 million people who voted for the CPP in July were allowed to be elected by the CPP to elect a new Prime Minister.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet criticized the old lady who attacked from Samdech Techo to his son and monitored Samdech's activities forever
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet warned those who want to demonstrate against Samdech tomorrow to think about the national image and not to violate Japanese law
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet told those who planned to protest against Samdech to be careful to affect Japan by criticizing the generational politics from father to son
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that this year has been 70 years for Cambodia-Japan relations, but this year is the highest level that the two countries have become strategic partners in all aspects.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that on December 22, Samdech will inaugurate a deep water port in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that the visit of Samdech abroad, the most important point in the economy is to promote Cambodia, we have products, we have to advertise
* Samdech Hun Sen stated that three out of five priorities of the seventh mandate government are economic growth, job creation and poverty reduction.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that in the case of Win Group proposing to open a taxi company in Cambodia, it is up to the company, but the right to allow or not to open is up to the Cambodian government. Samdech confirmed that the government has not allowed Win Group to operate electric vehicles in Cambodia
* Samdech Hun Sen Manet stated that those who misrepresented that the Samdech government had signed an agreement with Win Group to allow taxi drivers were ignorant.
Samdech Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government has not given a license to Win Group to operate a taxi in Cambodia.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the goal of the Royal Government of the 7th mandate is to help the waiters
Samdech Hun Sen tells tricycle and table riders not to worry about Vietnamese taxis
* Samdech Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government welcomes foreign companies to study and invest, but not all projects are allowed, there are points that must be banned in order to affect the national interest and the people of Cambodia.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet said, "Please believe me, I will lead the country by continuing to maintain the achievements of the Royal Government led by Samdech Techo in the last mandate."
* President Hun Manet stated that in any country in the world, there are people working abroad.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the work of the Royal Government is a big priority is to increase local employment through efforts to reach out
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet said that I always say that whatever you do, you must know how to breathe yourself, do not rely on others to breathe
* President Hun Manet said that whoever says Cambodia is a satellite of this country, that country says you go alone, but Cambodia needs to strengthen itself, train resources
* Samdech Hun Manet thanked Cambodian students, interns and citizens in Japan for their role as diplomats for Cambodia and for being praised by the Japanese people as hardworking people.
* President Hun Manet requested Japanese companies in Japan to continue to pay attention to workers and trainees from Cambodia
* Samdech Hun Sen Manet stated that on behalf of the Royal Government, which has diplomats as its staff, it must protect all Cambodians who go to work abroad.
* Samdech Hun Manet advised the Ministry of Labor of Cambodia to discuss with the Japanese side to reduce the cost of sending workers to a lower current.
* Samdech Mani President Hun Manet said that the new government does not sleep, is always moving forward for the people
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that he would like to ask analysts and commentators to be emotional before raising anything, please be clear.
* Samdech Mani Hun Sen instructs the Ministry of Foreign Affairs to study the possibility of establishing a Consulate General in Osaka in the future to facilitate the provision of services to Cambodian workers and citizens
* President Hun Manet stated that for Cambodian workers and citizens in Japan who want to renew their passports, they can go to the Cambodian Embassy in Korea without having to spend a lot of money to fly to Cambodia.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet Introduces New Year and Pchum Ben Ceremony for the Most Khmer Areas in Japan
Samdech Hun Sen calls on Cambodians abroad to uphold their dignity as tolerant and loyal citizens of other races
* President Hun Manet stated that the remaining 16% of the border issue with Vietnam is the Royal Government has tried to negotiate for the national interest.
* After thanking again and to the relevant parties in organizing the meeting, Samdech Manet Hun Manet concluded his speech at 1:15 pm on December 16, 2023.
