(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Red Cross organized the 7th General Assembly of the Cambodian Red Cross under the high presidency of His Excellency Dr. Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross on December 15, 2023 at the Hyatt Regency Hotel in Phnom Penh. . The conference ended successfully with the achievement of a series of great achievements for the humanitarian cause.
On the occasion of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen's continued role as the President of the Cambodian Red Cross for the 7th mandate, Samdech Kittipritthbandit recommended the executives at both the central and branch levels to determine the work direction as follows:
First, to further strengthen national-international cooperation with ministries, government institutions, the private sector, philanthropists, local communities and youth movements that support social activities and support humanitarian forces.
Second, the central level and branches must join in implementing the Phnom Penh Declaration on September 22, 2023 and must prepare plans and work directions in accordance with the national context in the spirit of strengthening ownership and responsibility. Quality, efficiency, productivity to meet the needs of the most vulnerable people.
Third, let's join together to focus on the importance and high attention to participate in the implementation of green development plans, reduce the use of plastic bags for fresh air, social welfare and better living conditions.
Fourth, the Cambodian Red Cross at all levels must pay attention to strengthening the solidarity, building and increasing the capacity of volunteers to contribute more actively in continuing to strengthen community resilience and in expanding education, outreach and promotion. Public health of the people with environment.
Fifth, let each official continue to pay attention to fulfill his / her role with a high sense of responsibility, work as a team, increase capacity to keep up with the new needs of technology and develop human capital, that is, to study, increase knowledge, have professional skills Good health, strong, clean, hygienic and moral.
Sixth: With the continued efforts of the Cambodian Red Cross, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen calls on his compatriots, especially philanthropists from all walks of life, to continue to support the mission of the Cambodian Red Cross "Local activities to achieve global goals. To build resilient communities, vulnerable people have a better and healthier life, from individuals to families to society as a whole.
The first meeting reviewed and approved the work direction for 2024 and the request for approval of the priority fund expenditure plan for 2024 of the Cambodian Red Cross. On that occasion, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, instructed the executives to implement the following effectively and efficiently:
1: Have a specific monthly work plan for each quarter and year
2: Must continue to implement the procedures for the use of funds
3. To continue to strengthen internal unity, work in a team spirit with high responsibility to monitor, evaluate and report regularly and have clear indicators.
4: Care must be taken to increase knowledge, skills, capacity building to respond to the needs in the digital age, including key priorities in line with the Pentagon Strategy of the Royal Government, the 7th legislature of the National Assembly and the strategy of the Cambodian Red Cross (2021). -2030).
Please be informed that this General Assembly is attended by 194 full members, including members of the Central Committee, representatives of relevant ministries and institutions, national elite working groups, delegates representing the 25 branches of the capital-province, volunteers. 14 Hearts, Phnom Penh Sub-Branch and Honorary President, Youth Advisor and President of the Cambodian Red Cross Youth Club of 24 Higher Education Institutions in Phnom Penh.
