Please be informed that the 7th General Assembly of the Cambodian Red Cross was held on Friday, December 15, 2023 at the Hyatt VC Hotel in Phnom Penh under the high presidency of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross.
The General Assembly was attended by 194 full members, including members of the Central Committee, representatives of relevant ministries and institutions, national elite working groups, delegates from 25 branches of the capital-province, 14 volunteers. Branches in Phnom Penh and Honorary President of Youth Advisor and President of CRC Youth Club of 24 Higher Education Institutions in Phnom Penh.
