Articles and pictures by Cambodia-China Friendship Radio The Cambodian Women's Association for Peace and Development Branch of the Ministry of Information provides humanitarian donations to children with intellectual disabilities and autism at Takhmao Special Education High School
Mr. Chan Sarin, Executive Director of Hope for HHC Community, said that the Royal Government of Cambodia has promoted people with disabilities, especially children with intellectual disabilities and autism in the field of public education. Significant increase in children with disabilities attending school with transparency, equity and gender.
But in late 2015, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports found that more than 60,000 children were still out of school, most of them mentally retarded and autistic. At the same time, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has launched a new policy on environmental education in 2018 to date to ensure that the education of all children with disabilities go to school.
"Children with congenital dementia need to be properly trained by their teachers to change their behavior and improve social relationships like other children," she said. Under the auspices of the Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, children with intellectual disabilities and autism through the Aid for Hope for the HHC community train children with intellectual disabilities and autism in life behaviors, knowledge and life skills.
She continued that due to the day-to-day efforts for peace, the development in Cambodia of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has turned the concerns of people with disabilities into opportunities for daily life and work, especially important contributions and Indispensable in the society.
During the meeting and visit, Ms. Tuy Sereyratanak praised and highly appreciated the teachers and school leaders who took care to help and teach children with intellectual and autistic children because children with intellectual and autistic children. They are different from normal children who are not easy to manage and train, and the training of teachers is done with satisfaction and full of love from the heart.
It should be noted that due to the increasing number of children with intellectual disabilities and autism, the head of the Royal Government through the Ministry of Education turned the HHC School of Hope for HHC into Takhmao Special Education High School on February 3, 2021. In the past, this high school allowed training from kindergarten to high school.
