(Phnom Penh): As of the first month of the official launch of vocational and technical training, the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training received 13,587 young people to register for vocational training throughout Country. This was confirmed by Mr. Kata On, Secretary of State and spokesman for the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training on the morning of December 15, 2023.
