(Phnom Penh): At least 65 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 13, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on December 14, 2023.
