It should be noted that from the implementation of the policy of openness to foreigners 45 years ago to the accession of the World Trade Organization 22 years ago, from the initiative of the "Belt and Road" 10 years ago until With the opening of the China International Import and Export Fair, the door of China's opening will be wider.
"A single flower blooms alone, not in spring. All kinds of flowers bloom in spring in the garden." In particular, China's large market should bring greater opportunities to the world to make development achievements more beneficial and equitable to the people of other countries.
