During the meeting, the Minister welcomed and thanked the French delegation for taking the time to pay a courtesy call and discuss development projects in the field of water resources and meteorology in Cambodia. Thanks to the French Agency for Development (AFD), especially the French Republic, which has always been supportive of Cambodia in all circumstances, particularly the significant contribution to water resources and meteorology.
