NEC Releases Press Release on the Inauguration of the Chairman, Vice-Chairman and Members of the NEC for the New Mandate
Mr. Prach Chan said that December 14, 2023 coincides with the 68th anniversary of Cambodia's accession to the United Nations and also the 31st anniversary of Cambodia's Angkor Wat inscription on the World Heritage List. This is the day when the NEC announces its inauguration in the new 7th mandate of the National Assembly.
Please be informed that His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, on December 13, 2023, yesterday issued a Royal Decree appointing Mr. Prach Chan as Chairman of the National Election Committee (NEC). Accompanied by the Vice President and a total of 9 members.
The locomotives of the new National Election Committee of the 7th National Assembly of the 9th National Assembly are: Mr. Prach Chan as the Chairman, Mr. Je Chamnan as the Vice Chairman and 7 other members: Mr. Mean Sati, Mr. Dim Sovannarom, Mr. Som Sorida, Mr. Heng Sileng, Mr. Yich Samith, Mr. Hal Sarath and Mr. Hang Puthea.
The composition of these new NEC locomotives was voted on by the National Assembly on Wednesday morning, December 13, 2023, during the first session of the 7th National Assembly. The National Election Committee (NEC) has the authority to plan, organize and administer elections throughout the country under the motto of independence, neutrality, truth, justice and transparency.
