Speaking at the ceremony, Mr. Suong Meng Tbong welcomed the meeting and the leaders of the organization with good cooperation to help the social sector and support poor children, vulnerable children and poor families in the community to get a decent living and study. At a private school or public school.
Mr. Suong Meng Tbong stated that the goal of Hope is to provide general education from kindergarten to secondary school for children in the community throughout the day, support orphans on a monthly basis, provide employment opportunities to people in the community. Send to job training to work in the organization.
The signing of the MOU between the Ministry of Social Affairs and Hope is now a three-year project with a total budget of $ 114,300.
It should be noted that Big Hope, a local non-governmental organization registered with the Ministry of Interior, has previously signed a project agreement with the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation.
Currently, the organization has requested to renew the project agreement with the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, named "School of the Heart for Science" by letter No. 1518, dated August 28, 2023.
Announcing the appointment of 4 officials as the director of the health center and 13 officials in the structure of Kampong Cham Provincial Health Department and announcing the termination of the position of one official
(Kampong Cham): The Kampong Cham Provincial Administration has announced the appointment of four officials as the new director of the health center and 13 other officials in the structure of the Kampong Cham Provincial Administrative Health Department, and announced the termination of the position of deputy director of the health center. Donty, too.
This proclamation ceremony was held on the morning of December 14, 2023 in the 55th Ordinary Meeting of the 3rd Provincial Council of Kampong Cham, chaired by Mr. Khlot Phorn, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Province. .
On that occasion, the Governor of Kampong Cham Province instructed the newly announced officials to pay attention to work to provide good health services to the people in accordance with the trust of the management and implementation. Work in line with the government's political program as well.
The provincial governor asked the four health center directors to incorporate the spirit of solidarity, which is guided by virtue in their hearts, so that the unit can grow and succeed in its duties.
Please note that this meeting has 5 agendas:
* First: Review and approve the draft minutes of the 54th Ordinary Meeting of the third mandate of Kampong Cham Provincial Council.
* Second: Review, discuss and approve the draft report summarizing the work results for November and the work direction for December 2023 of Kampong Cham Provincial Administration.
* Third: Review, discuss and approve the draft report summarizing the work results for 2023 and the work direction for 2024 of Kampong Cham Provincial Administration.
* Fourth: Review, discuss and approve the draft procurement plan for 2024 of Kampong Cham Provincial Administration.
