Minister Chay Borin said that under the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the country has achieved complete peace, national unity and complete territorial integrity. Under the wise leadership and long-term vision of Samdech Techo, peace, political stability, security, and public order have been vigorously maintained for more than 25 years, which is the foundation for development in all areas.
Samdech Say Chhum emphasized that all religions in Cambodia are carrying out their work smoothly in all parts of the country, adhering to the principle of close cooperation, solidarity, honesty, based on the principles of mutual tolerance and understanding. Circumstances to achieve unity, harmony, religion and society.
