(Phnom Penh): Oknha Song Saran, Chairman of the Board of the Rice Federation of Cambodia, confirmed that the Bank for Rural Development and Agriculture (ARDB) has contributed a lot to the rice sector, both rice prices and improve the situation in this sector over time. The last 10 years.
