Meeting with Governor of Kampong Speu, Senior Officials of Beijing Promise to Call on Chinese Investment Companies to Seek More Investment Opportunities in Cambodia, Especially in Kampong Speu
(Kampong Speu): On the morning of December 13, 2023, Mr. Vy Samnang, Governor of Kampong Speu Province, together with the Department of Specialization, met with Mr. Luo Yian, Vice Chairman of the Beijing Political Consultative Conference of the People's Republic of China, who was on a study visit. Discover the potential of Kampong Speu.
During the meeting, Mr. Vy Samnang mentioned the potential of the province, "Kampong Speu, we are an area with potential in agriculture, agriculture, tourism and aquaculture, especially in the garment, bags, shoes for export."
"Currently, in Kampong Speu, we want investment from the People's Republic of China in agriculture, agriculture, tourism and aquaculture, which are the basic needs of the people living in the province," he said.
In response, Luo Yian, vice chairman of the Beijing Political Consultative Conference of the People's Republic of China, said he would work hard to encourage investors from the People's Republic of China to study potential in some areas.
"After returning, he called on Chinese investors to seek as many investment opportunities as possible in agriculture, agro-industry, aquaculture and tourism in Kampong Speu province," he said.
The Governor of Kampong Speu Province thanked the Vice President of the Political Consultative Conference of Beijing of the People's Republic of China and the Chinese people for visiting and exploring the potential of Kampong Speu Province.
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of December 13, 2023, the 171st Military Squadron returned home safely after successfully completing its successful mission under the United Nations umbrella and with proud results. To the nation.
