Mr. Huot Hak informed the civil servants at the national level and the 25 capital-provincial departments to pay attention to understand the content and benefits of signing the memorandum between the Ministry of Inspection and Preah Keto Mealea Hospital.
The Minister continued that all civil servants of the Ministry of Inspectors have received health care services for all civil servants, including spouses, children, and parents, especially retirees of the Ministry, because health is very important.
On that occasion, Mr. Ly Kosal stated that in the past, under the wise leadership of Samdech Kittisangha Dr. Men Sam An, Minister of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, signed a Memorandum of Understanding between the Ministry of Inspection and Preah Ketomealea Hospital on Improving the welfare of civil servants of the Ministry of Inspection.
He said that today, under the new leadership of the two ministers, as well as Preah Keto Mealea Hospital, it is pleased to continue the signing of the Memorandum of Understanding. He sincerely hopes that this good cooperation will continue to last for a long time to come.
"Remembrance Night" event commemorating the inclusion of Angkor in the list of World Heritage Sites will be held tomorrow with spectacular views
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Pheung Sakona, Minister of Culture and Fine Arts, was invited to participate in various performances on the night of December 12, 2023 to prepare for the great annual event, the 4th Memorial Night. 2023 "to celebrate the 31st anniversary of the inclusion of the Angkor site as a World Heritage Site on December 14, 2023 tomorrow.
