(Battambang): Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Battambang Province, in the morning of December 12, 2023, presided over the 7th Consultation Forum with Associations, Non-Governmental Organizations and Local Communities in Battambang Province in 2023 at Meeting Hall, Building E, Battambang Provincial Hall.
