Samdech Hun Manet tells National Assembly President that the new Royal Government continues to build relations with Vietnam for the benefit of the Cambodian-Vietnamese nation (Video inside) (Hanoi, Vietnam): Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet affirmed in front of the National Assembly President. Of Vietnam that the new Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech himself, continues to maintain good relations with Vietnam for the benefit of both nations.
