The Standing Session of the National Assembly approved the resumption date of the first session of the National Assembly of the 7th legislature on Wednesday, December 13, 2023 at 8:00 AM with the same agenda: the vote of confidence in the composition of the National Election Committee. By the 9th National Assembly of the 9th above.
