On the morning of December 11, 2023, Lt. Gen. Prum Santhor, Deputy Commissioner General of the National Police, represented General Sar Thet, National Police Commissioner, presided over the opening ceremony of a training course on drug crime investigation and money laundering. Methods and laws on drug control at the General Commission of the National Police.
