Lt. Gen. Prum Santhor reminded all participants four points:
First, to adhere to the rules, regulations and guidelines of the training, especially to have a good attitude, dignity, worthy of a united force to promote the honor and prestige of the National Police Force.
Second, please pay attention to absorb the subjects that the coaches have taught according to the planned program to increase capacity and fulfill professional duties.
Fourth, when you have acquired knowledge, you must know how to share it with your team and be a person who knows how to share for ourselves, our team, our office and our organization.
