Strengthen national defense, maintain peace and political stability so that no force can destroy it, eliminate all forms of political extremism, strengthen security, order and social security, provide warmth for people to live in peace, both physically and mentally
Defend the constitutional monarchy, protect the throne and protect the King, the highest shrine, from being abused by anyone. Continue to strengthen liberal, multi-party democracy and promote respect for human rights through the rule of law. Participate actively in the election of the 5th legislature of the Senate and the election of the Capital, Provincial, Municipal, District and Khan Councils of the 4th mandate, strictly in accordance with the laws, regulations and procedures of the election.
* Continue to promote the process of in-depth reform in various fields with a strong will and consistency through the approach of "mirroring, bathing, scrubbing, treatment and surgery" to ensure good governance, social justice and development. Strengthen the provision of public services to the people effectively, cleanly and respond in a timely manner to the needs of the people.
* Maintain macroeconomic and public financial stability, strive to promote economic growth in 2024 to achieve the planned on the basis of wise use of Cambodia's favorable and promote the implementation of strategies and policy frameworks of the Royal Government in the field. Effective economy
* Continue to develop the health system, promote social welfare and promote human resource development
* Continue to improve the lives of civil servants, the armed forces, retirees and veterans, promote the protection of the rights, dignity and interests of workers and pay attention to solving the problems of traders, vendors and other business people in Informal economy.
