The Cambodian People's Party (CPP) continues to convene the Extraordinary General Assembly on the second day to increase the composition of the Vice-Chairman and members of the Standing Committee (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): On the morning of December 10, 2023, the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) continued to convene the Extraordinary General Assembly. Extraordinary nationwide representation at 7 Makara Palace, Phnom Penh on the second day.
The Extraordinary General Assembly lasted for two days, on December 9-10, 2023, under the chairmanship of Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, Honorary President of the Cambodian People's Party, and Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party.
