(Phnom Penh): After confessing his guilt after the execution of his girlfriend by covering his nose with a pillow and squeezing his neck, he was hanged at the bathroom door in the rented room and the killer was brought to the police. Police Inspectorate of Po Sen Chey District, Phnom Penh on the night of December 08, 2023 to proceed with legal procedures.
According to the Por Senchey District Police Officer, the perpetrator, 20-year-old Phum Pha, was born in O'Kiki Kandal Village, Lumlong Commune, Anlong Veng District, Oddar Meanchey Province and lived in Room 37, 1st floor, a rented house in Trapeang Thleung 2 Village, Sangkat. Chom Chao I, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
He killed his girlfriend, 19-year-old Sim Rady, who was born in Sambour village, Prey Kuy commune, Stung Sen district, Kampong Thom province. Before her death, she lived in a rented house with her widowed mother in the village. And he had only one daughter.
The killer confessed that he really killed her as a girlfriend because he was angry, she broke up with someone new and asked to break up and cut off ties with him for a while. He killed her on the night of December 5, 2023 in the room above, when he asked to check her phone, but she refused to see, there was an argument.
He then pushed her to the ground, covered her nose with a pillow and strangled her until she was paralyzed. . He then slept in the room until the morning of December 6, 2023, then left the room and locked the door from the outside and fled to Oddar Meanchey province.
Police said that Oddar Meanchey province was his hometown and he stayed there for one night looking for a place to escape until December 7, 2023, decided to leave his hometown and travel to Kralanh district, Siem Reap province. When he arrived, he felt uneasy and did not know where to escape, so on the morning of December 8, he went to the Kralanh District Police Inspectorate and confessed his guilt in front of the police.
