Run Ta Ek Natural Village is located in Run Ta Ek Commune, Banteay Srei District and Pak Sneng Area is located in Pak Sneng Commune, Angkor Thom District, Siem Reap Province, a new village established by the Royal Government for people moving out of the Angkor resort area. Arranging the relocation of people from the land of Angkor is the most important task in meeting the requirements of UNESCO, in particular to protect the global value of Angkor sites in the World Heritage List.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Thipdey's opportunity to meet with the people living in Run Ta Ek village and wearing horns:
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet expressed his pleasure to meet with the people of Run Ta Ek.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet brought the message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to visit the people living in Run Ta Ek and wearing horns.
* Samdech Hun Sen Manet stated that Samdech Techo Hun Sen met the people of Run Ta Ek and wore horns up to 4 times, which is a show of concern and care for the people and the other is the consideration of Angkor. .
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the temple of Angkor is a symbol of Cambodia and an invaluable treasure.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the temple in the Angkor resort area of 401 square kilometers must be maintained together because it is not damaged and can be rebuilt.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the Angkor resort will be removed from the World Heritage List if it does not comply with UNESCO criteria.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet asked whether it is appropriate to leave the ancestral temple left for thousands of years, but we, the next generation of Cambodians, can not preserve the value of the ancestral temple together?
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that between the temple and the people, the Royal Government chooses both.
Samdech Hun Sen praised General Kheng Someth for taking more than 400 days to turn the Run Ta Ek area from empty land into a lot of infrastructure.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that Samdech's visit to Run Ta Ek now shows the commitment to continue the spirit of developing the Run Ta Ek area for the betterment of the people.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the organization of infrastructure and administrative system in Run Ta Ek is the direction of turning this area into a city.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet requested the people living in the Angkor resort area to cooperate in implementing the Royal Government's measures to protect the Angkor resort.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet seeks the understanding of the people of Run Ta Ek on the difficulties arising from the selection of housing. Samdech Thipadei affirmed that he will continue his efforts to develop Run Ta Ek into a better place to live.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet instructed the authorities to transform Banteay Srei into a city.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet decided to hand over the framework to 8 floating officials who work at Run Ta Ek Health Center.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised EDC to connect the electricity to Run Ta Ek Health Center for free.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet recommends the installation of Run Ta Ek Health Center to District 1 Referral Hospital.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet decided to provide a school building with 2 floors equal to 12 rooms to the school in Run Ta Ek.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet decided to provide a framework for 10 teachers who are teaching at Run Ta Ek School.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised EDC to connect the electricity network to the school in Run Ta Ek.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet decided to provide 5 computers, 5 printers and 2 photocopiers to Run Ta Ek School.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet decided to provide 10 buses to transport people from Run Ta Ek to Siem Reap for free.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet reacts to the criticism that the people were left in Run Ta Ek. Samdech Dhipati wants critics to come down and see for themselves. He said that Cambodia is not a rich country, so what to do step by step.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised the relevant ministries, especially the Ministry of Agriculture and Tourism, to consider economic development for the people of Run Ta Ek.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training to consider providing vocational training to the people of Run Ta Ek.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet finished his speech at 10:30, thank you for watching the live broadcast on Fresh News TV. The Police Academy of Cambodia announces the recruitment of 200 scholarship students through a four-year Bachelor of Police Science competition.
