Samdech Techo Hun Sen Warmly Welcomes Lawyer Sam Sokong to Apply to Join the Political Life of the Cambodian People's Party (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, on the evening of December 7, 2023 For lawyer Sam Sokong, who asked to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party.
Please be informed that Mr. Sam Sokong, President of the Candlelight Party and a permanent member of the Candlelight Party, released a video and submitted an official letter of respect to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party. .
In a video obtained by Fresh News on December 7, 2023, lawyer Sam Sokong, who is often heard by the public when protesting for members or supporters of the opposition, claimed that his decision Leaving the opposition party and joining the political party with the ruling party is because of seeing the great merits of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to the motherland and the people of Cambodia, especially the search for peace for Cambodia.
Mr. Sam Sokong added that the decision was based on the policies and strategic plans of the new government, which has Prime Minister Hun Manet as Prime Minister. "I would like to join the Cambodian People's Party from now on," he said.
