He said that in the past, people in some provinces cut rubber, grow cashews, cut cashews, grow rubber because he was not sure when the product was expensive, they would run to grow crops, so he suggested to the cashew association to increase awareness. From the principle that people understand the plan and cooperation between private sector associations and growers in harmony.
