Going to find cardamom in the forest near the foot of the mountain, the ghost was attacked by a bear and was seriously injured, but his father came to save him
(Pursat): A teenage boy was attacked by a bear and his father fought with the bear to save his life while the father and son went to remove cardamom in the forest near the foot of the ghost mountain in Veal Veng district, Pursat province.
This incident happened at 1:45 pm on November 6, 2023 at the point of Tralach at the foot of Phnom Khmoch in Chheuteal Chrum village, Bramoy commune, Veal Veng district, Pursat province.
Sources from the victim's family said that before the incident, the victim, 15-year-old Rim Ran, was asked by his father to leave the house to remove the cardamom to sell to make a living at the foot of the local ghost mountain. Veal Veng, Pursat province, more than 3 km away from home.
The source said that after the father rescued his son from the bear and brought him home, he reported to the authorities and took the ambulance to the Pursat Provincial Hospital. Russey Keo District Police Arrest Two Suspects for Drug Use
