Colonel Toch Kimsong further stated that for the exhibits confiscated by the police after the crackdown on the two suspects, there was a black and green Scooter motorcycle from the 2023 series with the license plate Phnom Penh 1KH 0645 and a Rielmi mobile phone. Black with SIM card number 070 899 416 (belonging to the victim).
