Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh: Only December 2 and January 7 bring peace and development to the country
(Koh Kong): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh on December 7, 2023 presided over the 45th Anniversary of the United Front for the Development of Motherland Cambodia on December 2 and was welcomed by government officials, monks, students and people. A large crowd gathered at the Victory Monument in Khemarak Phoumin, Koh Kong Province.
Samdech Pichey Tea Banh said that the December 2 Front was the day that Samdech Techo Hun Sen mobilized the United Army and asked the Vietnamese Army to join forces to liberate the country from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot. Only December 2, January 7, January 7, the people will have progress in this country and have peace, and born of the victorious political strategy that brings complete peace and national unity.
Samdech Pichey Sena added that for the past 45 years, the Cambodian People's Party and all the people have lived together in the front line, overcoming all obstacles, big and small, very bravely. The spirit of December 2, the spirit of January 7, which is embedded in the consciousness of all our people, has become a great force in the creation of great achievements of the society.
Now, in the light of peace, freedom, national conscience and in a position connected to our own destiny, we all believe that there will be no recurrence of tragedies like in the past.
In order to maintain lasting peace, let all our compatriots unite, love each other, adhere to the patriotic tradition, connect with the people, and strive to serve the nation and maintain peace and development. For the development of the country in the future.
