In response to this spirit, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has incorporated the above four key points into five "model school standards" for kindergarten through secondary school to increase attention on strengthening discipline, ethics, and ethics. Virtue and good behavior of education staff and students, in which the Ministry has set a score of 80 percent on knowledge, 10 percent on skills and 10 percent on morality and behavior.
