He said this during a press conference to present the results of the first meeting of the Supreme Advisory Council, which was chaired by Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet on December 6, 2023.
According to Mr. Chhim Phal Varunu, the political party that wants to apply for membership in the Supreme Advisory Council after one week of the establishment of this mechanism, the political party is only a normal member, but the mode of operation is the same as the founding members. . Political parties named as regular members receive only three delegates, while founding members are entitled to six delegates.
