Taking this opportunity, the representatives of each group, with hundreds of members, appealed to people from all walks of life, associations, organizations, informal economists to join the Royal Government to get the opportunity to develop society together and stop the action. Those that do not benefit the society.
Finally, the Informal Economy Group has set a goal by 2024 to announce an additional 500 members of the Informal Economy of the Khmer Mohanakor Youth Association.
