Speaking at the press conference, Mr. HUN Many said that through the dissemination and receipt of applications for the competition for the recruitment of 250 commune agriculture officials in 2023 for 2023 from November 1 to 30, there are candidates There were 12,744 applicants and 3,329 people who completed the form and all the conditions were assessed correctly.
