Agricultural officers who are preparing for this exam fall into the framework of "A", "B", "C" at the end of the exam during the one-year internship period according to the target commune, in which the agricultural officer receives the lowest salary 1 4 million Riels according to the type of framework and plus 160,000 Riels monthly allowance as well as other benefits of civil servants.
