(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Information, Mr. Neth Pheaktra, announced the reopening of the Ministry of Information's Vocational Training and Journalism Training Center, which has played an important role in training human resources in the field of journalism and audio-visual in Cambodia in the past. Go.
The announcement of the opening of the Vocational Training Center for Journalism and Criticism was made on the occasion of the Minister of Information presiding over the opening of the training course on "Breaking News" to more than 40 ministry officials on the afternoon of December 4, 2023. Chaktomuk Mongkul Hall, Ministry of Information.
The opening of this training center was evaluated by the Minister of Information as a preparation of human resource training for successors in the field of information and audio-visual, and also in response to the current market demand, as well as to improve the quality. Professional journalism ethics in Cambodia.
For the first step, the Journalism and Vocational Training Center of the Ministry of Information provides internal training and is open to associations and journalists who are interested in training can come and study, because the training facility organized by the Ministry of Information is expected to Will play an important role in improving the quality of information and ethics of the journalism profession even better.
He stressed that the work of the Ministry of Information as a whole can move forward depending on a large number of human resources because it is an important factor and the death of our Ministry. We have good plans, good policies, good materials, but without human resources, things will not work out well.
Therefore, the Ministry of Information has reorganized the journalism and training center, which is important in playing a role in creating human resources for the information sector in Cambodia.
The re-establishment of the journalism vocational training center is in the main direction of building human resources in the field of information, and not only within the framework of the Ministry of Information, but for the field of information as a whole, because the vision is to move forward. How to improve the quality of the press in Cambodia.
This consideration ensures the sustainability of the Ministry of Information and will increase the capacity of officials for successors with specific knowledge and skills.
However, the nation's traditional media, radio and television, need to focus on the production of content and technology, and what is the most important need to understand the current needs of the people? To attract viewers and listeners is to adapt to the real needs of the society that people use a lot of Facebook and TikTok.
At the same time, what we need to look forward to is the rise of information technology and the evolution of the media from analog to digital, from digital to AI, which we are at a stage that has not yet begun in the beginning. But they have already used the AI system one step at a time. Within the framework of national security management and information security management is inseparable from the AI system.
