(Kampong Cham): On December 3, 2023, a video was posted and shared on social media about a man who was handcuffed by a group of people in a naked shirt and shorts. .
As for the cause of this story, Mr. Im Hach accused the people of being angry with him for filming the video of transporting timber from day to night, chasing after the motorcycle and arresting him at the grocery store. Ly Seng Hong brand construction. However, according to the explanation of the four residents, it was confirmed that Im Hach entered their house without permission between 22:00 and 23:00 on the same day of the year. Record the place to store the wood.
In this case, the police force of Cheung Prey District Inspectorate and the Provincial Police Commissioner, under the coordination of the procedure by the representative of the Prosecutor's Office of the Kampong Cham Provincial Court, brought both parties for questioning, collected evidence and worked with the relevant competent institutions to find the same results. Below:
* 1: This case is a dispute between individuals, not related to the police to arrest Im Hach. Instead, the police are collecting and compiling cases to provide justice to both parties.
* 2: Im Hach was a journalist in the CNM (CNM) unit, but was fired from the unit on November 1, 2023. According to the Ministry of Information, Im Hach has not yet been registered as an official news agency at any media outlet.
* 3: In the case of transporting timber, which is the project in Mr. Im Hach's broadcast, it is wood that people bought from legal depots (Permission of the Department of Agriculture, Hunting and Fisheries, Kampong Cham Province, No. 21/23 April 16, 2023) for the purpose of housing construction with the certification of local authorities.
