The President of the National Assembly said that the trade volume of the two countries has increased significantly from 160 million US dollars in 2022 to 206 million US dollars in the first six months of 2023. Laos is a country with great potential for electricity, and Cambodia also has a lot of demand for this energy in the development of the country.
Mr. SONEXAY SIPHANDONE warmly welcomed the visit of the senior leadership of the National Assembly of Cambodia in Laos as very important in deepening and deepening the cooperation between the two countries in all fields. Both the legislature and the executive.
The Prime Minister supported the remarks made by the National Assembly and emphasized that during a meeting with His Excellency Hun Manet during a recent visit to a forum abroad, the leaders of the two countries made a joint commitment. Together in continuing and promoting the strengthening of traditional ties to achieve more results that will bring benefits to both countries.
He stressed that although Laos is facing some economic and financial problems, the Lao state and party have put in place a number of programs to address this issue effectively. 2024 is the year of tourism in Laos, we hope that more foreign tourists will come to Laos to contribute to improving the lives of people.
