Increase exchanges and cooperation in the field of health, including traditional Chinese medicine and Chinese traditional medicine, promote the establishment of the Cambodia-China Traditional Medicine Cooperation Center. The Chinese side will continue to send a team of Chinese traditional medicine doctors to Cambodia.
