"I would like to call on all tour operators, national and international tourists, local authorities and the people to participate more actively in the race, clean city, clean resort, good service, good hospitality and cooperation to maintain beauty, hygiene, environment, which is the main factor. "Indispensable to maintain the beautiful coastal area for a long time to continue to inherit to the next generation."
In addition, Samdech urged the relevant ministries and institutions to continue to give priority to the development of coastal areas, especially the construction of infrastructure necessary to serve the tourism sector and to expand connectivity from one area to another, including land, rail and air. To facilitate the travel of tourists from the temple area and other areas to the coast.
