* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet praised Mr. Som Piseth, Governor of Kep Province for his efforts to build and develop Kep Province to receive various awards in a row.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that the development of Kep is for the benefit of the people of Kep.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the master plan designed to maintain the province has the potential for long-term tourism, not for the short term.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that the master plan for the development of the four coastal provinces is not to compete between provinces, but to help each other.
