(Kampong Chhnang): Farmers in Kampong Chhnang province have been harvesting rain-fed rice with a happy heart because this year's rice yield is very good, this year's rice price is high, they did not expect these From the attention of the Royal Government to promote the agricultural sector.
On the morning of December 3, 2023, Fresh News in Kampong Chhnang province met with many farmers who were busy harvesting rain-fed rice mixed with laughter in the field. The fields do not seem to be tired.
Meanwhile, four farmers gave an interview to Fresh News about this year's rice yield and price, which is more developed than in previous years, to know that this year's rice yield is the same as anywhere else. High yields because this year the rice crop received enough rainfall, which did not flood like in previous years, causing the rice to rot and damage.
As for the price of rice, all kinds of rice this year is also higher than in previous years, which is a normal rice variety that farmers in rural areas, Chamkar, rural areas tend to do every year, compared to previous years, mixed rice prices. Dried rice costs only 800 to 900 riel per kilogram, but this year dry rice mix costs 1,300 riel per kilogram.
Separately, Rumduol rice or Romduol flower, in previous years, dried rice cost only 1,100 riel per kilo, but this year, Rumduol dried rice costs 1,500 riel per kilogram, this price makes farmers very happy. .
For rice prices continue to be high as today, all farmers do not forget to express their gratitude and heartfelt gratitude to the Royal Government, which has mainly promoted the agricultural sector, making this year's rice prices higher. Rising prices from year to year and change the lives of farmers to be prosperous from now on.
They also requested the Royal Government to help reduce the price of fertilizer to some price, so that farmers can quickly change the lives of those who are engaged in farming in rural areas.
