"The increase in the number of full-time troops is due to the growing threat to our country in connection with special military operations (the war of Ukraine) and the continued expansion of NATO," the Russian military said. According to the Russian military, the number of Russian troops will increase to about 170,000, which is enough to respond to the "threatening actions of the NATO bloc".
