(Phnom Penh): On the morning of December 1, 2023, Dr. Osman Hassan, Senior Minister in charge of Special Mission and Vice Chairman of the Cambodian Halal Product Inspection Committee, led 13 Cambodian delegates to attend the 10th Thai Halal Conference. 2023 in Bangkok, Thailand.
The conference will be held for three days from December 1-3, 2023, which is important to help strengthen the Cambodian halal sector. Every year since 2014, three Thai halal institutions have jointly organized the Halal Conference. Thailand to invite halal institutions in ASEAN countries and the world to share their experiences and progress.
This year's Thai Halal Conference under the theme of Digital Halal Initiative to Promote Halal Confidence and aims to ensure the quality of halal products that use digital technology and build trust in the halal ecosystem that makes it easier for customers to do business effectively. Transparency.
