Vice President of the National Assembly of Vietnam: The visit of the President of the National Assembly of Cambodia to Vietnam shows the close feelings and trust
(VOVworld) - After arriving in the Socialist Republic of Vietnam on the night of November 30, 2023, National Assembly President Khuon Sodary, President of the National Assembly of Cambodia, met with Nguyen Duc Hai, Vice President of the National Assembly of Vietnam and Chairman of the National Assembly Friendship Group. Cambodia at the hotel where Samdech stayed in Hanoi.
On that occasion, Mr. Nguyen Duc Hai congratulated on the successful election of Cambodia in July, as well as the establishment of the National Assembly and the Royal Government of the seventh mandate, which received overwhelming support from the people. The Vice President of the National Assembly congratulated National Assembly President Khuon Sodary on being elected by the National Assembly as the new Speaker of the National Assembly and the first woman to hold such a high position.
Nguyen Duc Hai considers that the official visit of the National Assembly President, accompanied by members of the new National Assembly Standing Committee to Vietnam, shows the deep friendship and trust between the two countries. He considered that this visit will contribute to the strengthening and deepening of friendship and cooperation between the two countries, both the legislature and the executive to be stronger and deeper.
He requested the National Assembly President to continue to promote and enhance the cooperation between the two parliaments, such as the exchange of visits, the promotion of cooperation between young MPs and the two countries' parliamentary friendship group. Be more active.
In response, National Assembly President Khuon Sodary supported the remarks made by the Vice President of the National Assembly of Vietnam. Samdech expressed his deep gratitude for the warm welcome of the Vietnamese friends to all the Cambodian National Assembly delegation on this occasion. He praised Vietnam's rapid progress under the right leadership of the Vietnamese Party and State.
The National Assembly President reminded of the good relations between Cambodia and Vietnam established by His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk, His Majesty the King and President Ho Chi Minh as a relationship in difficult circumstances and worked together to end the war, territorial reunification and gain. Independent.
Please be informed that National Assembly President Khuon Sodary has been leading a high-level delegation of the National Assembly of Cambodia to pay a three-day visit to the Socialist Republic of Vietnam from November 30 to December 2, 2023. He will then continue his visit to the Lao People's Democratic Republic from December 2 to 4, 2023.
The first official and friendly visit of the leaders of the 7th National Assembly to the neighboring countries now not only strengthens the friendship and cooperation between the National Assembly, but also contributes to the promotion of relations between the people and the people. People also encourage trade and investment.
