For the five major tasks that Samdech decided to assign the Ministry of Mines and Energy to lead and coordinate, including:
* First, to promote the implementation of energy efficiency in accordance with the National Policy on Energy Efficiency 2022-2030 approved by the Royal Government and in accordance with the planned action plan.
