Samdech Mani President Hun Manet announces the cessation of the project to develop a 700-megawatt coal-fired power plant in Botum Sakor district, Koh Kong province, to be converted to LNG instead (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): On November 30, 2023, the Minister of Cambodia announced the decision to suspend the development of a 700-megawatt coal-fired power plant in Botum Sakor District, Koh Kong Province.
