This was stated by Samdech Hun Manet on the occasion of presiding over the closing ceremony of Stung Ta Tai Leu Dam in Thmar Bang District, Koh Kong Province on November 30, 2023.
Such an announcement by the Prime Minister to ensure both the goal of carbon neutrality and the goal of energy supply with quality, stability, efficiency and affordability.
