When the driver arrived at the scene, he shouted at the victim, shot him in the head and then got out of the car with a black metal flashlight, chased the victim and the victim ran away, then the suspect threw the flashlight at the surface. The face of the left eyebrow causes the wound to bleed.
After the incident, the victims detained the suspect and handed over the exhibits to the police at the 1st Chao Chao Administrative Police Station for questioning, but the suspect refused to tell and answer.
