(Oddar Meanchey): This is considered as one in 1,000 accidents where a man was slightly injured while the tractor was completely damaged by a mine explosion while plowing.
This shocking incident happened at 05:40 pm on November 24, 2023 in Tram Pong Tbong village, Preah Pralay commune, Trapeang Prasat district, Oddar Meanchey province.
According to the Preah Pralay Commune Administration Police Post, the victims of the mine explosion were 27-year-old Thleang Rath, 27-year-old Ron Si, and a small child living in the commune.
Police said that before the incident, the victim was driving a tractor MacBalarus (Soviet) hanging on the ground near the village, causing the mine floor to explode, damaging the tractor completely, while the victim was slightly injured. Go for treatment at Trapeang Prasat District Hospital.
