Kim Jong-un made the remarks during a visit to the North Korean National Space Technology Administration on Thursday to attend a party where North Korean Prime Minister Kim Tok Hun claimed that intelligence satellites would develop capabilities. The North Korean military to become the best army in the world capable of attacking targets around the world.
