(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Environment has already installed its lanterns to celebrate the Royal Water Festival, float lanterns and worship the moon Ok Ambok, which will take place for 3 days from 26, 27 and 28 This coming November 2023 along the Tonle Sap River in front of the Royal Palace of Phnom Penh.
