Senate Holds a Meeting of the Standing Committee of the Senate to Decide on 4 Agendas
(Phnom Penh): The Honorary Legal of Dr. Simka, First Vice President of the Senate of Cambodia, this morning, November 23, 2023, held a meeting of the Standing Committee of the Senate to review and decide on four agendas.
* 1: Examine and decide on the request of the Committee on Economy, Finance, Banking and Auditing to include the draft law on the payment of the general state budget for the management of 2022 into the agenda of the 11th session of the 4th Senate.
* 2: Examine and decide on the request of the Committee on Economy, Finance, Banking and Auditing to include the draft law on finance for management in 2024 in the agenda of the 11th session of the 4th Senate.
* 3: Examine and decide on the request of the Commission on Public Transport, Civil Aviation, Post, Telecommunication, Industry, Mining, Energy, Trade, Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to submit a clear draft on the approval of the Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement between the Royal Government. Of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the United Arab Emirates into the agenda of the 11th session of the Senate of the 4th legislature.
* 4: Determine the agenda and date of the resumption of the 11th session of the Senate of the 4th legislature.
After reviewing and discussing, the Standing Committee of the Senate set Friday, November 24, 2023 at 8:00 am to continue the 11th session of the 4th Senate to review and comment on the three draft laws. On this.
