(Siem Reap): Under the policy of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia of the shadow of peace, the Siem Reap Provincial Administration under the leadership of Mr. Prak Sophoan, the Governor of Siem Reap Province, organized the Water Festival, floating lanterns and worshiping the moon, which will take place from November 25-28, 2023
The Royal Water Festival is organized to entertain the people as well as national and international tourists to visit the historical land, which is rich in temples, natural resorts, safe, orderly. And a good environment and also the restoration of tourism in Siem Reap.
In addition, this cultural event is also dedicated to the past, the emperor of the Khmer Empire under the leadership of King Jayavarman VII, that generation of heroes, who led the brave navy with heroism and Full of fighting ability, which liberated the motherland from the aggression of the enemy and achieved national unity and built a prosperous society to this day.
The Royal Festival is a major national festival associated with a deep belief in the sentiments of Cambodian ancestors long ago to commemorate the river that brings fertile soil for cultivation. The fruit of the peasants is also a reminder of gratitude to the Master who was born as a bodhisattva rabbit and dedicated himself to the realization of the inauguration.
