Please read the announcement of Electricite du Cambodge as follows: This morning, Samdech Hun Sen presided over the opening of the Cambodia Vision 2023 Conference.
The "Vision of Cambodia" conference is an important forum to bring together experts to discuss topics related to economic and social issues as input for solving challenges and finding opportunities to promote development in Cambodia.
The "Vision of Cambodia" conference has been held annually for more than 10 years. The Cambodia Vision 2023 conference is held under the theme "Cambodia Vision 2030 and Next: Determining the Path to Prosperity, Sustainability and Environment".
Cambodia has set ambitious goals to become a high middle-income country by 2030 and a prosperous economy by 2050. To find a way forward, the Cambodian Institute for Training and Research (CDRI) Initiated an extensive research to contribute to this vision.
The Cambodia Vision 2023 Conference, organized by the CDRI Institute, will present the progress of this ongoing research study and evaluate comprehensive policy options emerging from future scenarios.
The 2023 conference serves as an important forum for more than 500 leaders, including government officials, scholars and national and international experts to come together to address Cambodia's key challenges.
Through this Cambodia Vision 2023 conference, CDRI Institute continues its commitment to bring together the most influential leaders from Cambodia, Southeast Asia, etc. To overcome challenges and understand the vision of Cambodia 2030 and Vision 2050.
Addressing the G20 leaders for the first time since the beginning of the war, the Kremlin chief received the tragedy of the Ukrainian war, saying: "What is happening in Ukraine is a tragedy and they must seek "The way to stop it."
