Arguing that Moscow was trying to achieve justice in Ukraine, the Russian president said that tensions in the world economy were not due to Russia but to the actions of other countries.
Russia says it has launched its "special military operations" in Ukraine "to destroy and disarm Ukraine and to protect its Russian-speaking population." But the West considers the military campaign, which began in February 2022, a war of aggression.
