(Phnom Penh): Professor Chheang Ra, Minister of Health, on November 21, 2023, led the 7th training course on "Leadership and Innovation" for civil servants under the Ministry of Health from the director of the health center. Up to 1,821 leaders of the Ministry of Health participated in the video conference.
The purpose of this training is to strengthen the capacity of health officials at all levels through leadership and innovation training, which is one of the three priority strategies of the Ministry of Health and to support reform. Implementation of the Royal Government's Pentagon Strategy for the 7th Legislature of the National Assembly.
The content of this week's training focuses on four key points, including: 1. Explaining why the right, clear and appropriate authority is needed for change to make it better.
