Mr. Keo Rattanak's remarks were made on the occasion of participating in a forum on "Mining and Energy Policy in Cambodia" held on November 21, 2023.
The Minister said that the Ministry of Mines and Energy has been working with development partners, including the Asian Development Bank (UNDP) and Australia, to promote energy efficiency policies to protect the environment to meet Cambodia's commitment to global climate change. Having set energy saving goals.
He stated that the Royal Government's plan from 2023-2030 wants to create a movement for people to understand and participate in saving electricity.
Mr. Keo Rattanak emphasized this during a press conference on "Mineral and Energy Policy in Cambodia" on November 21, 2023 at Sokha Hotel, Phnom Penh.
He said, "I would like to take this opportunity to announce to the people and all journalists that the Ministry of Mines and Energy on November 2, 2023 requested the Prime Minister not to expand the mining and quarrying business. In the Lang Wildlife Sanctuary. "On November 2, 2023, he agreed on the second day, the same day, which shows the will of the president to Prey Lang."
Prey Lang is a large forest in Cambodia with an area of 431,683 hectares, covering four provinces: Kampong Thom, Preah Vihear, Kratie and Stung Treng.
According to the Minister of Mines and Energy, there are currently 13 local and foreign companies studying mining in the area from 2008 to the present, including three companies in Kampong Thom province that have obtained exploration licenses and 1 gold mining license, in Kratie province there are 7 licenses, Preah Vihear province has 2 exploration licenses and Stung Treng province has 1 exploration license.
Mr. Keo Rattanak confirmed that "this year, EDC has prepared a subsidy of 130 million dollars to help prevent discounts to some sectors."
Mr. Keo Rattanak said that we have now announced and implemented a special discount to the agricultural sector for pumping water at a rate of only 480 riels per kilowatt hour, this pump refers to pumping at night between 9 o'clock. Night to 7 am, in addition, also provides a special rate to the animal husbandry processing in agriculture, as long as the agricultural input to be processed by the state.
The second type of discount is also offered to those who are trying to expand their business at night, offering a discount of up to 20%.
