The composition of the CEC to be selected for each provincial capital is 7 people with the following positions:
1: Chairman of the Capital and Provincial Election Commission 1: Deputy Chairman of the Capital and Provincial Election Commission 1: 3: Member in charge of Administration 4: 1 Member in charge of Finance 5: 1 member in charge of electoral and technical operations 6: 1 member in charge of legal services, litigation and election security 7: 1 member in charge of education, information and public relations 1
