The following is the full text of the announcement: The Senate Standing Committee will convene on November 23 to review and decide on the four agendas (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): The Senate will convene its Standing Committee meeting. On Thursday, November 23, 2023, to review and decide on four agendas.
Please be informed that the four agendas are as follows:
* 1: The request of the Committee on Economy, Finance, Banking and Auditing to include the draft law on the payment of the general state budget for the management of 2022 into the agenda of the 11th session of the 4th Senate.
* 2: The request of the Committee on Economy, Finance, Banking and Auditing to include the draft law on finance for management in 2024 on the agenda of the 11th session of the 4th Senate.
* 3: Request of the Commission on Public Transport, Civil Aviation, Post, Telecommunication, Industry, Mining, Energy, Trade, Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to request a clear draft on the approval of the Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement between the Royal Government of Cambodia and the Government of Cambodia. United Arab Emirates on the agenda of the 11th session of the Senate of the 4th legislature.
