Ministry of Social Affairs awarded gold level certificates to factories that recruit more people with disabilities to work
(Koh Kong): On November 21, 2023, Mr. Chea Somethy, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, assigned Mr. Sorn Sophal, Director General of the General Department of Rehabilitation, to lead a delegation of the Ministry to visit and hand over the gold level certificate to the Yazaki Factory. Cambodia) Pradak, who has done a good job in recruiting people with disabilities to work.
Mr. Sorn Sophal, Head of Delegation, instructed and requested the factory to continue to recruit people with disabilities to work more and pay attention to all means and encourage employees with disabilities to identify at the Commune / Sangkat Administration to obtain ID cards. Have a disability.
Pursuant to the Law on the Protection and Promotion of the Rights of Persons with Disabilities, as well as Sub-Decree No. 108 on the Determination of Procedures for the Recruitment of Persons with Disabilities, the Ministry of State Institutions with 50 or more civil servants shall have One official with a disability, which is equivalent to 2% for the private sector with 100 or more employees, must have one employee with a disability, or 1%.
Please note that Yazaki is a company that has performed its obligations to obey the law well, with people with disabilities working at a rate higher than 1%, which exceeds the legal obligations. From 2019 to 2023, the company has received the gold level certificate for 5 consecutive years on the implementation of the above obligations.
