(Phnom Penh): On November 20, 2023, Lok Chumteav Dr. Pech Chanmon Hun Manet, Vice Chairman of the Board of Directors of the Samdech Techo Association of Volunteer Doctors (TYDA), was invited to receive a donation of $ 200,000 from Chip Mong Group. Represented by Duke Leang Khun, Co-Founder and Chairman of the Board of Chip Mong Group.
