"Please join as a role model on road traffic safety by driving right, leaving the right safety space from the vehicle ahead and respecting the road traffic law consistently," he said.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Peng Po Nea, Minister of Public Works and Transport, presided over the dissemination of Prakas on the use of the road and Prakas on the safety of driving vehicles on the afternoon of November 20, 2023.
