On the morning of Monday, November 20, 2023, at the ASEAN Secretariat in Jakarta, the Republic of Indonesia, Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary-General of ASEAN, met with His Excellency Sergey Glaziev, Member of the Council (Minister) in charge of Integration and Macroeconomics. European Economic Commission, Asia.
During the meeting, the two sides discussed practical economic cooperation possible to promote trade and investment, digital transformation and sustainability in ASEAN and the EU-Asia Economic Union.
On the morning of Monday, the first day of the ASEAN-EU-Asia Economic Union Day, to celebrate the 5th anniversary of the signing of the Memorandum of Understanding between ASEAN and the EU-Asia Economic Commission at the ASEAN Secretariat in Jakarta, Indonesia, Dr. Kao Kim Hourn Along with other dignitaries, he addressed the opening ceremony of the event, which will take place from 20 to 24 November 2023.
The MoU aims to promote economic cooperation to contribute to trade, investment and economic expansion between ASEAN and the EU member states.
