(Svay Rieng): On the occasion of the two-day boat race in Svay Rieng province from November 18-19, 2023, more than 550,000 national and international tourists came to visit.
Mr. Van Sarath, Director of Svay Rieng Provincial Department of Tourism, said that in this year's boat race in Svay Rieng, tourists as well as people attended the main destinations organized by the provincial administration, there are exhibitions, large-scale concert venues. The view along the Wai Ko River at night and the fireworks show attract more than 550,000 tourists.
Please note that in this year's boat race, there are a total of 67 boats from the capitals and provinces and boats in Svay Rieng, including: traditional international boats with a capacity of 22 people, 57 boats and three-board boats. There are 10 cards for 3 people, with a total of 1,639 participants (11 women).
In this boat race, the first place of international standard boat received 20 million Riels, the second place received 15 million Riels, the third place received 10 million Riels, the first place of three-deck boat category received 5 million Riels. 3 million riels and the third place got 1 million riels. Separately, all boats that participated in the race that did not win received some additional sponsorship.
